# Git Workflow

See AGENTS/06-git-workflow.md for full details.

## Branch naming
```
feature/<description>     feature/bulk-export
fix/<description>         fix/thumbnail-memory-leak
docs/<description>        docs/update-api-registry
refactor/<description>    refactor/search-aggregation-service
```

Never commit directly to main.

## Commit format (Conventional Commits)
```
feat: add bulk export to browse page
fix: resolve thumbnail blob URL memory leak
docs: update api-integrations.md
test: add unit tests for DocumentDetailService
refactor: extract tag service from document-detail
```

## Before committing
```bash
npx nx affected -t lint    # must pass
npx nx affected -t build   # must pass
npx nx affected -t test    # must pass
```
Husky pre-commit hook runs lint automatically.

## PR creation
```bash
gh pr create \
  --title "feat: <description>" \
  --body "$(cat .github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md)" \
  --base main
```

## JIRA linking
Include ticket in PR title: `feat(NCO-1234): add bulk export`

## Never
- Never force-push to main
- Never --no-verify to skip hooks
- Never commit .env files
- Never commit node_modules
